rom the PRESENCE design matrix, which if I understand correctly, allow detection to vary by either primary or secondary sampling period. I have been trying to figure out how to do this in unmarked, but haven&#39;t been successful. I&#39;m sure this means I don&#39;t fully understand the models, but hopefully I&#39;ll understand them better over time.<br><br>Thank you in advance,<br>John"
